From 69b7ab05efe0f523c83ed7ae29963b74037fb320 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Miguel <kuboloko.info@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 22:29:17 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] feat(cotl): add data, scoped styles and shared components

Building blocks for the Children of the Lance fan subsection, all kept
out of src/routes/ so the router does not treat them as pages:

- data/site.ts, data/characters.ts: all editable text and character
  bios in one place, no component changes needed to update content
- styles/cotl.css: dark epic-fantasy theme, fully scoped under .cotl
  so it cannot affect the rest of kuboloko.pt
- components/: CotLLayout (navbar + footer wrapper), CotLNav, CotLFooter
  (mandatory legal disclaimer on every page), CharacterCard, ArtCredit
  (artist credit shown beside borrowed artwork), CotLLogo (logo image
  with a text wordmark fallback until the file is added)
- lib/head.ts: shared head() builder, defaults every page to noindex

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
